<div xml:space="preserve">
<p begin="65398667t" end="94094000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle0"><span style="style_1">[engine revs]</span></p>
<p begin="113780334t" end="149482667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle1"><span style="style_1">[Jerry] </span><span style="style_3">This is a 1967 Austin-Healey 3000</span><br/><span style="style_3">in ice blue.</span></p>
<p begin="170503667t" end="198198000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle2"><span style="style_3">It has a straight-six,</span><br/><span style="style_3">150-horsepower engine.</span></p>
<p begin="215882334t" end="251918334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle3"><span style="style_3">This is a car if you wanna say,</span><br/><span style="style_3">"I really love British sports cars.</span></p>
<p begin="252585667t" end="278945334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle4"><span style="style_3">"And damn it, I will go down</span><br/><span style="style_3">with that ship if I have to."</span></p>
<p begin="318333333t" end="330333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle5"><span style="style_3">-Hello?</span><br/><span style="style_3">-Ricky?</span></p>
<p begin="332000000t" end="342666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle6"><span style="style_3">-Who's that?</span><br/><span style="style_3">-Jerry.</span></p>
<p begin="343333333t" end="353333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle7"><span style="style_1">[Ricky] </span><span style="style_3">Hello, man.</span></p>
<p begin="354020334t" end="365365001t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle8"><span style="style_3">-How's it going?</span><br/><span style="style_3">-</span><span style="style_1">[Jerry] </span><span style="style_3">What are you doing?</span></p>
<p begin="369702667t" end="401067334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle9"><span style="style_1">[Ricky]</span><span style="style_3"> Oh. Sitting out, I think I've got</span><br/><span style="style_3">irritable bowel syndrome.</span></p>
<p begin="402000000t" end="417666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle10"><span style="style_1">[Jerry] </span><span style="style_3">Oh, God, that is irritating.</span></p>
<p begin="418084334t" end="440773667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle11"><span style="style_1">[Ricky laughs] Yeah.</span></p>
<p begin="441774667t" end="459459000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle12"><span style="style_1">-[Jerry] </span><span style="style_3">You wanna grab a coffee?</span><br/><span style="style_1">-</span><span style="style_3">Yeah.</span></p>
<p begin="497830667t" end="539205334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle13"><span style="style_3">I'm Jerry Seinfeld, and this is</span><br/><span style="style_1">Comedians in Cars Getting Coffee.</span></p>
<p begin="543666666t" end="567333333t" region="region_2" xml:id="subtitle14"><span style="style_3">Today my guest is my good friend</span><br/><span style="style_3">Ricky Gervais.</span></p>
<p begin="569666666t" end="597666666t" region="region_2" xml:id="subtitle15"><span style="style_3">He's a very funny, silly,</span><br/><span style="style_3">English comedian guy.</span></p>
<p begin="598333333t" end="608000000t" region="region_2" xml:id="subtitle16"><span style="style_1">[laughs]</span></p>
<p begin="609333333t" end="628666666t" region="region_2" xml:id="subtitle17"><span style="style_1">[Jerry]</span><br/><span style="style_3">And he's just funny. He makes me laugh.</span></p>
<p begin="629295334t" end="643976667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle18"><span style="style_1">-What do you think?</span><br/><span style="style_1">-[Ricky] It's great.</span></p>
<p begin="651317334t" end="669001667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle19"><span style="style_1">-English.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-Is it?</span></p>
<p begin="675000000t" end="698666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle20"><span style="style_1">-Is it?</span><br/><span style="style_1">-I don't know anything.</span></p>
<p begin="699031667t" end="712378334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle21"><span style="style_1">-You don't know anything about cars?</span><br/><span style="style_1">-No.</span></p>
<p begin="728728000t" end="745077667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle22"><span style="style_1">-Is this the seat belt?</span><br/><span style="style_1">-What do you think so far?</span></p>
<p begin="745745000t" end="768434334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle23"><span style="style_1">-I think it's a death trap.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-It is.</span></p>
<p begin="777666666t" end="803000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle24"><span style="style_1">There's no way there's a little air bag</span><br/><span style="style_1">in there, is there?</span></p>
<p begin="806806000t" end="838170667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle25"><span style="style_1">-There is, but you have to blow it up.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-[laughing]</span></p>
<p begin="839000000t" end="858000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle26"><span style="style_1">Quick, we're gonna crash.</span></p>
<p begin="864864000t" end="875875000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle27"><span style="style_1">Right.</span></p>
<p begin="909241667t" end="930596334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle28"><span style="style_1">Well, I'm a very nervous passenger,</span><br/><span style="style_1">so let's...</span></p>
<p begin="941666666t" end="963333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle29"><span style="style_1">-Did you eat?</span><br/><span style="style_1">-I had some cereal.</span></p>
<p begin="966632334t" end="989655334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle30"><span style="style_1">-That's so sweet.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-What?</span></p>
<p begin="990322667t" end="1004003000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle31"><span style="style_1">What kind of cereal?</span></p>
<p begin="1018666666t" end="1041333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle32"><span style="style_1">We can't be running out</span><br/><span style="style_1">of stuff to talk about already.</span></p>
<p begin="1043709334t" end="1067066001t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle33"><span style="style_1">If we're going into detail on the cereal,</span></p>
<p begin="1075666666t" end="1086333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle34"><span style="style_1">we're struggling.</span></p>
<p begin="1111777334t" end="1128127000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle35"><span style="style_1">There's a dancing traffic cop.</span></p>
<p begin="1129000000t" end="1151666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle36"><span style="style_1">He's dancing, he's really</span><br/><span style="style_1">having a good time.</span></p>
<p begin="1154820334t" end="1169501667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle37"><span style="style_1">She's dancing, too.</span></p>
<p begin="1181847334t" end="1196195000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle38"><span style="style_1">We're in the middle of </span><span style="style_3">Fame.</span></p>
<p begin="1210666666t" end="1221000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle39"><span style="style_1">Irene Cara.</span></p>
<p begin="1221666666t" end="1239666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle40"><span style="style_1">Irene Cara.</span><br/><span style="style_1">She did the song, didn't she?</span></p>
<p begin="1244666666t" end="1254333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle41"><span style="style_1">Yes, </span><span style="style_3">Fame</span><span style="style_1">.</span></p>
<p begin="1257000000t" end="1272333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle42"><span style="style_1">I'm gonna live forever.</span></p>
<p begin="1274940334t" end="1299965334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle43"><span style="style_1">-I'm gonna learn how to fly.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-Yeah.</span></p>
<p begin="1300632667t" end="1329328001t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle44"><span style="style_1">People are gonna see me and die.</span><br/><span style="style_1">Well, who's gonna pay for that?</span></p>
<p begin="1333666666t" end="1350000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle45"><span style="style_1">I think they meant it in a sort of...</span></p>
<p begin="1354666666t" end="1388333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle46"><span style="style_1">-I saw Irene Cara, I died.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-Ah, I see.</span></p>
<p begin="1389000000t" end="1408000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle47"><span style="style_1">-Yeah, exactly.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-In a more like this way.</span></p>
<p begin="1408666666t" end="1425333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle48"><span style="style_1">-I died.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-I died.</span></p>
<p begin="1425757667t" end="1434766667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle49"><span style="style_1">-Yeah.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-I see.</span></p>
<p begin="1463000000t" end="1475000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle50"><span style="style_1">Look at this guy.</span></p>
<p begin="1476141334t" end="1509841667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle51"><span style="style_1">Nobody can explain</span><br/><span style="style_1">why the homeless have such fabulous hair.</span></p>
<p begin="1510509001t" end="1533532001t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle52"><span style="style_1">I love how you start</span><br/><span style="style_1">with "no one can explain."</span></p>
<p begin="1534333333t" end="1572000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle53"><span style="style_1">Like scientists have been working</span><br/><span style="style_1">around the clock for the last 25 years.</span></p>
<p begin="1573666666t" end="1592666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle54"><span style="style_1">They've spent billions</span><br/><span style="style_1">of government dollars,</span></p>
<p begin="1593258334t" end="1608607000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle55"><span style="style_1">but they've not come up with anything.</span></p>
<p begin="1609274334t" end="1634633000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle56"><span style="style_1">Like, who commissioned</span><br/><span style="style_1">this scientific study?</span></p>
<p begin="1654333333t" end="1670333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle57"><span style="style_1">Okay, here we go.</span></p>
<p begin="1671336334t" end="1682013667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle58"><span style="style_1">[engine revving]</span></p>
<p begin="1685666666t" end="1701666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle59"><span style="style_1">No, be sensible.</span></p>
<p begin="1718049667t" end="1728059667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle60"><span style="style_1">[Jerry] Oh, Jerry.</span></p>
<p begin="1741406334t" end="1750415334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle61"><span style="style_1">Jesus.</span></p>
<p begin="1751082667t" end="1765096667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle62"><span style="style_1">Sorry,</span></p>
<p begin="1765764000t" end="1780111667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle63"><span style="style_1">are we in </span><span style="style_3">The Italian Job?</span></p>
<p begin="1780779000t" end="1792791000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle64"><span style="style_1">Why are we doing this?</span></p>
<p begin="1802000000t" end="1822666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle65"><span style="style_1">Oh, no, that made it worse. You--</span></p>
<p begin="1827158667t" end="1852517334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle66"><span style="style_1">Jerry! For [bleep] sake!</span></p>
<p begin="1856855000t" end="1879544334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle67"><span style="style_1">We're going 70 miles an hour.</span></p>
<p begin="1885000000t" end="1902000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle68"><span style="style_1">We're not going 70.</span></p>
<p begin="1915666666t" end="1927000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle69"><span style="style_1">[Ricky] Let's take the bus.</span></p>
<p begin="1942333333t" end="1951333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle70"><span style="style_1">[Jerry] Oh, Jerry.</span></p>
<p begin="1962627334t" end="1971636334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle71"><span style="style_1">Oh, God.</span></p>
<p begin="1983333333t" end="2023666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle72"><span style="style_1">Jerry, why is it so funny</span><br/><span style="style_1">to frighten a grown man?</span></p>
<p begin="2033333333t" end="2048000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle73"><span style="style_1">Fear is funny.</span></p>
<p begin="2052383667t" end="2081412667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle74"><span style="style_1">-Fear is funny, yeah.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-Especially when it's not fake.</span></p>
<p begin="2082080000t" end="2114779334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle75"><span style="style_1">We're so used to fake fear.</span><br/><span style="style_1">Everyone always acts scared,</span></p>
<p begin="2115446667t" end="2135800334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle76"><span style="style_1">-pretends their scared.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-This is real, don't worry about it.</span></p>
<p begin="2136467667t" end="2161826334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle77"><span style="style_1">I'm in a tin bucket with no suspension.</span></p>
<p begin="2170168000t" end="2181846334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle78"><span style="style_1">Oh, Jesus.</span></p>
<p begin="2186851334t" end="2201866334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle79"><span style="style_1">When was the last time</span><br/><span style="style_1">you were this scared?</span></p>
<p begin="2202533667t" end="2232230000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle80"><span style="style_1">Doing award shows</span><br/><span style="style_1">and potentially ending my career is my...</span></p>
<p begin="2233231000t" end="2254252000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle81"><span style="style_1">That's my adrenaline rush.</span></p>
<p begin="2254919334t" end="2276607667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle82"><span style="style_1">I work for the Golden Globe committee.</span></p>
<p begin="2289287000t" end="2326324000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle83"><span style="style_1">And this entire thing is a ruse</span><br/><span style="style_1">to get you to do the show again next year.</span></p>
<p begin="2327333333t" end="2337333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle84"><span style="style_1">Yeah.</span></p>
<p begin="2338000000t" end="2375333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle85"><span style="style_1">And I'm just gonna keep driving you</span><br/><span style="style_1">in this terrifying car until you agree.</span></p>
<p begin="2385666666t" end="2398000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle86"><span style="style_1">Oh, God.</span></p>
<p begin="2416000000t" end="2434666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle87"><span style="style_1">I think the first couple,</span><br/><span style="style_1">they were sort of...</span></p>
<p begin="2437000000t" end="2455666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle88"><span style="style_1">They were taken aback.</span></p>
<p begin="2462333333t" end="2501333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle89"><span style="style_1">"Why is this Brit saying</span><br/><span style="style_1">all these awful things to us?"</span></p>
<p begin="2504666666t" end="2548666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle90"><span style="style_1">And then by the third one,</span><br/><span style="style_1">they go, "He's telling jokes. I get it."</span></p>
<p begin="2552000000t" end="2576000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle91"><span style="style_1">What was the introduction for Mel Gibson?</span></p>
<p begin="2582666666t" end="2605333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle92"><span style="style_1">"I like a drink as much as the next man.</span></p>
<p begin="2606000000t" end="2624666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle93"><span style="style_1">"Unless the next man is Mel Gibson."</span></p>
<p begin="2631666666t" end="2645000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle94"><span style="style_1">That's a great joke.</span></p>
<p begin="2645666666t" end="2668333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle95"><span style="style_1">I like a joke that</span><br/><span style="style_1">sneaks up on you like that.</span></p>
<p begin="2668999667t" end="2715379334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle96"><span style="style_1">Yeah. Oh, Jesus Christ! Ow!</span></p>
<p begin="2716046667t" end="2741739000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle97"><span style="style_1">I can't understand</span><br/><span style="style_1">why this company went out of business</span></p>
<p begin="2742666666t" end="2764666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle98"><span style="style_1">shortly after this car was made.</span></p>
<p begin="2775666666t" end="2796333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle99"><span style="style_1">You really are holding on seriously there.</span></p>
<p begin="2797000000t" end="2805333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle100"><span style="style_1">[Ricky] Yeah.</span></p>
<p begin="2806000000t" end="2836666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle101"><span style="style_1">It feels like I'm being dragged along</span><br/><span style="style_1">in a tin bath.</span></p>
<p begin="2837666666t" end="2855000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle102"><span style="style_1">That's what this feels like.</span></p>
<p begin="2886884000t" end="2921919001t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle103"><span style="style_1">Oh, God, you have to turn around</span><br/><span style="style_1">like an owl to see.</span></p>
<p begin="2922920001t" end="2949613334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle104"><span style="style_1">There's no mirror in this car.</span></p>
<p begin="2950280667t" end="2964294667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle105"><span style="style_1">Jerry, you can't...</span></p>
<p begin="2964962000t" end="2993657334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle106"><span style="style_1">There's a mirror here.</span><br/><span style="style_1">I see exactly what I'm doing.</span></p>
<p begin="3000666666t" end="3022333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle107"><span style="style_1">-Oh, Christ.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-[Jerry] What are you worried about?</span></p>
<p begin="3023020000t" end="3032362667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle108"><span style="style_1">[Ricky] What am I worried about?</span></p>
<p begin="3052716334t" end="3083747334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle109"><span style="style_1">I was thinking maybe for the drive back,</span><br/><span style="style_1">we'd put the top down.</span></p>
<p begin="3090087001t" end="3100097000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle110"><span style="style_1">Whatever.</span></p>
<p begin="3109106000t" end="3124788334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle111"><span style="style_1">For [bleep] sake.</span></p>
<p begin="3125455667t" end="3142806334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle112"><span style="style_1">Oh, come on, Jerry, this is mental.</span></p>
<p begin="3143807334t" end="3174838334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle113"><span style="style_1">You don't need to do this.</span></p>
<p begin="3179843334t" end="3200197000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle114"><span style="style_1">We're going for coffee, for Christ's sake.</span></p>
<p begin="3201666666t" end="3229000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle115"><span style="style_1">We're not going to diffuse a bomb, right?</span></p>
<p begin="3231000000t" end="3246666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle116"><span style="style_1">There's no need for this.</span></p>
<p begin="3252000000t" end="3276000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle117"><span style="style_1">Even Jack Bauer had an hour, right?</span></p>
<p begin="3300297000t" end="3315645667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle118"><span style="style_1">It's turned into a race now.</span></p>
<p begin="3316313000t" end="3351681667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle119"><span style="style_1">-It's like a scene from </span><span style="style_3">Ronin.</span><br/><span style="style_3"/><span style="style_1">-[laughing]</span></p>
<p begin="3352666666t" end="3377666666t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle120"><span style="style_1">That was a good laugh to start the day.</span></p>
<p begin="3382333333t" end="3409000000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle121"><span style="style_1">My pain and suffering is</span><br/><span style="style_1">for everyone else.</span></p>
<p begin="3413000000t" end="3432333333t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle122"><span style="style_1">-I fall over for your amusement.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-Yes. Yes. Yes.</span></p>
