<p begin="7427086334t" end="7459452000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle253"><span style="style_1">The funniest part of that joke is,</span><br/><span style="style_1">"Say what you will about Hitler."</span></p>
<p begin="7495488000t" end="7521847667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle254"><span style="style_1">I'm gonna go to the toilet</span><br/><span style="style_1">and take a Valium for the journey back.</span></p>
