<p begin="7815474334t" end="7847506334t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle261"><span style="style_1">Jesus, this is like free falling.</span></p>
<p begin="7848173667t" end="7873198667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle262"><span style="style_1">I know, it's fantastic.</span><br/><span style="style_1">Don't you feel alive?</span></p>
