<p begin="7887546334t" end="7909234667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle264"><span style="style_1">-Even if only for a few more minutes.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-Shut up!</span></p>
<p begin="7924917000t" end="7959284667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle265"><span style="style_1">[Jerry] I bet you this car looks great.</span><br/><span style="style_1">I'm in heaven.</span></p>
