<p begin="8003996000t" end="8035360667t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle268"><span style="style_1">We're in stylish sunglasses,</span><br/><span style="style_1">we got the top down...</span></p>
<p begin="8036028000t" end="8053045000t" region="region_1" xml:id="subtitle269"><span style="style_1">-Yeah.</span><br/><span style="style_1">-in a poncy roadster.</span></p>
